          "anchors": [
            "all",
            "59%"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "MSI's price list actually shows the old prices (from a week ago) as well as the new ones, giving us an official percentage difference of 10-20%.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-07-28T08:02:10.376948+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "a3217c1d93127ff7833bf734a931d51dc193ea779491fd4c6820ccaff1609cb4",
          "excerpt": "MSI's price list actually shows the old prices (from a week ago) as well as the new ones, giving us an official percentage difference of 10-20%.",
          "sentence_hash": "bfe02ec55ae50e5de36767e8978716e12bc82c88ac7108f708a0caea04827128",
          "anchors": [
            "all",
            "20%"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "The RTX 5080 Shadow 3X OC/Ventus sees the biggest change, going from 10,000 Yuan ($1,477) to 12,000 Yuan ($1,773), constituting a 20% hike.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-07-28T08:02:10.376980+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "a3217c1d93127ff7833bf734a931d51dc193ea779491fd4c6820ccaff1609cb4",
          "excerpt": "The RTX 5080 Shadow 3X OC/Ventus sees the biggest change, going from 10,000 Yuan ($1,477) to 12,000 Yuan ($1,773), constituting a 20% hike.",
          "sentence_hash": "50d0958075627e4565d6899fc8b15de230560f1f5c368eacf25b52e435239b9e",
          "anchors": [
            "$1,773",
            "$1,477",
            "20%"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "Other RTX 5080 variants received a pretty similar 18% hike, while the RTX 5070 Ti Shadow 3X OC now costs 19.5% more.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-07-28T08:02:10.377000+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "a3217c1d93127ff7833bf734a931d51dc193ea779491fd4c6820ccaff1609cb4",
          "excerpt": "Other RTX 5080 variants received a pretty similar 18% hike, while the RTX 5070 Ti Shadow 3X OC now costs 19.5% more.",
